• Contribute to and support selected participants at SCAR Antarctic Conservation and Management workshop (South Africa, June 2011);
• EBA has endorsed the III Portuguese Conference on Polar Sciences (Coimbra, Portugal) in April 2011;
• Continue to support the development of outputs from IPY programmes under the EBA umbrella (in particular, Aliens and Tarantella, plus two planned synthesis volumes to be prepared as part of the IPY legacy book series);
