• Antarctic Biodiversity Database. Responsible: Dave Watts (dave.watts@aad.gov.au);
• Antarctic Map Catalogue. Responsible: Henk Brolsma (henk.brolsma@aad.gov.au);
• BEDMAP - Antarctic Bedrock Mapping. Responsible: Alexander Paul Cooper (aprc@bas.ac.uk);
• CGA - Composite Gazetteer of Antarctica. Responsible: Roberto Cervellati (roberto.cervellati@consorzio.pnra.it);

